## Step 6: Set up .env

**Open `.env` and paste this (use SQLite for MVP speed):**
```
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./specialstem.db
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-change-this-in-production-min-32-chars
ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30